  "//": [
    "Forges -- monolithic single volumes with one dark recessed mouth. Mass is",
    "the message, so appendages are kept to a minimum: stone is masonry-chamfered,",
    "steel adds riveted banding, and the arc tier trades its chimney for a coil",
    "ring. The mouth is modelled, not textured -- a dark surround with an emissive",
    "plate set back inside it, because a glow painted flat on a wall reads as a",
    "sticker and a recess reads as a fire.",
    "",
    "Ported from modelgen/gen_forge.py and gen_fabricator.py. Blender was Z-up",
    "and this is Y-up, so what was that file's y is this file's z."
  ],

